<p>Image 6 is licensed under Wikimedia Commons and may be accessed <a href="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/House_in_the_Woods.JPG" target="_blank">here</a>. Image manipulation my own work.</p>
<p>Image 7 is licensed under Wikimedia Commons and may be accessed <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Veiled_Nun_(Giuseppe_Croff).jpg" target="_blank">here</a>. Photo manipulation my own work.</p>

