			<div class="content" id="post-content-3637974">
									

<p>He has returned!</p>
<p>After an initial skim, I decided to +1. Will probably do a more in-depth reading later.</p>
<p>Edit: did not regret my +1</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;potential&nbsp;spoilers</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The last picture was honestly the most creeepy for me, and it acted as a marvelous punchline. It looks like somebody with a cloak pulled over their head. The last scene of SCP-3084 is the men pulling the old woman's cloak over the young woman's head.</p>
<p>But this creates more questions than answers for me. Where did they find her? Why does it look like she's in a lake? What's with the VCR stuff? Is this another film anomaly? 701? 993? 1981?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>All in all, great skip.</p>

